    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "BANK03 / Centro de operaciones",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Salud del banco · Desarrollo\nSLO **99.5%** · Métricas reales · Actualización cada **30 s**\n\nLa ventana SLO es de 30 días, pero la historia disponible puede ser menor. **Sin datos ≠ cero ni servicio saludable.**"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Disponibilidad HTTP · 30 días",
      "description": "Disponibilidad HTTP observada (30 días); objetivo 99.5%. Los valores se calculan sobre las muestras disponibles; no se rellenan ausencias con cero.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - (sum(increase(bank_http_requests_total{service=\"api-gateway\",environment=\"dev\",route!~\"/(health(/.*)?|healthz|salud|ready|readyz|metrics)\",status_class=\"5xx\"}[30d])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(bank_http_requests_total{service=\"api-gateway\",environment=\"dev\",route!~\"/(health(/.*)?|healthz|salud|ready|readyz|metrics)\"}[30d])))",
          "legendFormat": "Observado"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
